Runic Desktop is an independent managed .NET runtime for web-powered desktop
applications.

The managed bridge implementation is informed by WebUI's wire protocol and
MIT-licensed TypeScript bridge. WebUI is Copyright (c) 2020-2026 Hassan Draga
and contributors, distributed under the MIT License:
https://github.com/webui-dev/webui

The complete upstream license is retained at
eng/licenses/WebUI-LICENSE.txt and in the Runic.Desktop package under
licenses/WebUI/.

The Windows embedded host uses Microsoft Edge WebView2 through the
Microsoft.Web.WebView2 SDK. Its license and third-party notices are retained at
eng/licenses/WebView2-LICENSE.txt and eng/licenses/WebView2-NOTICE.txt.
